    angle: "You have already succeeded, and the ayah names the one thing it is measuring: those who are humbly submissive in their prayer. Not those whose prayer is long. Not those who never lose the thread. Khushu‘ is where the mind is, not how the prayer looks from outside — and it is the first quality Allah lists when He describes the ones who have won.",
